# Secrets & credentials — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.key.json
*service-account*.json
credentials.json
token.json
secrets/

# Raw vendor samples contain real PII (names, GSTINs, phone numbers, bank
# details) and must never be committed unscrubbed. Only samples_sanitized/
# (produced by scripts/scrub_samples.py) is tracked. The redaction mapping
# itself necessarily contains those same real values as its "find" side, so
# it's gitignored too -- it was accidentally committed in scrub_samples.py
# for a while (fixed retroactively; see git history rewrite around T41).
/samples/
scripts/scrub_mapping.local.py

